      "classification": "vulnerability",
      "code_path": "src/app/dashboard/overall/page.tsx::OverallDashboardPage::L10-145",
      "proof_trace": "The page fetches `profile.is_admin` (lines 18-29) but never evaluates it as an access gate — there is no `if (!profile.is_admin) redirect(...)` before calling `getOverallStats(30)` on line 32. All three server actions (`getOverallStats`, `getDailyAttendanceCounts`, `getDailyAttendanceDetails`) use `createSupabaseAdminClient()` which bypasses RLS and perform no authorization check themselves. The `/dashboard/overall` link is also shown unconditionally in `DashboardNav.tsx` (no `isAdmin` guard), and `src/middleware.ts` performs no admin check on this route.",
      "attack_scenario": "Any authenticated member (registered + card linked) navigates directly to `GET /dashboard/overall`; the server renders full cross-user attendance statistics — today's active headcount, total member count, all-member activity hours, and per-team/per-grade daily breakdowns — without verifying `is_admin`.",
      "checklist_id": "PROP-attendanceze-pre-004"
    },
    "text": "Admin aggregation view must verify is_admin before returning cross-user attendance data.",
    "assertion": "forall req: admin_aggregation(req) => req.user.is_admin == true",
    "covers": "SG-005",
    "severity": "HIGH",
    "type": "pre-condition"
  }
}

